      "MARIA: Why are you hurrying, Clo-Clo?\nCLO-CLO: Oh, it's you. Faker!\nMARIA: Take a card, Clo-Clo. See what the night holds for you.\nCLO-CLO: Your cards are a joke. I wouldn't give you a centavo.",
      "TERESA: Mamacita, let me in! Let me in, let me in!\nSENORA DELGADO: Hah!\nTERESA: If you love me, let me in -- !\nSENORA DELGADO: Mamacita -- let me in. Let me in, now that I've spent half the night getting the corn meal!",
      "ROSITA: My mistress, Consuelo Contreras, does not have to beg for flowers. She won't miss one.\nCLO-CLO: Thank the Senorita for me.",
      "MARTA: Shhh!\nSENORA CONTRERAS: It will spoil the birthday song, Rosita, if we wake her too soon.",
      "CLO-CLO: Well ——\nCLO-CLO: See you tomorrow —-\nMARIA: Tomorrow -—"
    ]
